*% Generated as a compatibility template for the EPSON L355.
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "EPL355.PPD"
*Product: "(EPSON L355)"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 550"
*ModelName: "EPSON L355"
*ShortNickName: "EPSON L355"
*NickName: "EPSON L355 , Epson Inkjet Printer Driver (ESC/P-R) for Linux"
*Manufacturer: "Epson"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: True
*DefaultColorSpace: RGB
*FileSystem: True
*Throughput: "1"
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsLanguages: "en"
*cupsVersion: 1.2
*cupsManualCopies: True
*cupsModelNumber: 1
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 0 epson-escpr-wrapper"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*VariablePaperSize: False
*1284DeviceID: "MFG:Epson;MDL:L355;DES:EPSON L355;"

*OpenUI *PageSize: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: A4
*PageSize A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595.20 841.80]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612.00 792.00]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Legal/US Legal: "<</PageSize[612.00 1008.00]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A5/A5: "<</PageSize[419.60 595.20]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize B5/JIS B5: "<</PageSize[516.00 728.60]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A6/A6: "<</PageSize[297.60 419.60]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 4x6/10 x 15 cm (4 x 6 in): "<</PageSize[288.00 432.00]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 2L/13 x 18 cm (5 x 7 in): "<</PageSize[360.00 504.40]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *MediaType/Print Quality: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *MediaType
*DefaultMediaType: PLAIN_NORMAL
*MediaType PLAIN_HIGH/plain papers-High: "<</HWResolution[360 360]>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType PLAIN_NORMAL/plain papers-Standard: "<</HWResolution[360 360]>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType PMMATT_HIGH/Epson Matte-High: "<</HWResolution[360 360]>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType PMMATT_NORMAL/Epson Matte-Standard: "<</HWResolution[360 360]>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType PMPHOTO_HIGH/Epson Premium Glossy-High: "<</HWResolution[360 360]>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType PMPHOTO_NORMAL/Epson Premium Glossy-Standard: "<</HWResolution[360 360]>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType ENV_HIGH/Envelope-High: "<</HWResolution[360 360]>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType ENV_NORMAL/Envelope-Standard: "<</HWResolution[360 360]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *MediaType

*OpenUI *Ink/Grayscale: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 120 AnySetup *Ink
*DefaultInk: COLOR
*Ink COLOR/Off: "<</cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsColorSpace 1/cupsCompression 1>>setpagedevice"
*Ink MONO/On: "<</cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsColorSpace 0/cupsCompression 1>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Ink

*DefaultResolution: 360dpi
*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 360dpi
*Resolution 360dpi/360 dpi: "<</HWResolution[360 360]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*OpenUI *ColorModel/Color Mode: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 40 AnySetup *ColorModel
*DefaultColorModel: RGB
*ColorModel RGB/RGB: ""
*ColorModel CMYK/CMYK: ""
*CloseUI: *ColorModel

*% End of PPD
